WEBVTT

00:00:02.706 --> 00:00:05.927
Open Settings, where the members of the workspace are managed.

00:00:06.327 --> 00:00:09.037
Type your teammate's email address, and choose a role.

00:00:09.929 --> 00:00:11.166
Then press Invite.

00:00:11.316 --> 00:00:13.514
Your teammate appears in the list of members.

